# The LLDB pack's glue and what no unit builds with: glue.sh, the workers'
# sources it bundles, the pack's tests and their fixtures, and its
# documents. An edit to any of these rebuilds no toolchain.
glue.paths
glue.sh
package.json
package-lock.json
compress.mjs
README.md
src/
test*.mjs
test.sh
tests/
# The instrumenter crate's formatting, which nothing builds with.
instrument/rustfmt.toml
